[I] Low-level library for netfilter related kernel/userspace communication

[T] libnfnetlink is a userspace library providing low-level handling of
[T] nfnetlink, the netlink based kernel/userspace transport layer of the
[T] netfilter subsystems. It is the base of libraries such as
[T] libnetfilter_queue and libnetfilter_conntrack.

[U] https://www.netfilter.org/projects/libnfnetlink/

[A] Libnfnetlink Authors
